  "Alternate work sessions and short breaks.\n\n• Pause suspends the timer without saving.\n• Record session saves whole minutes and prepares a new work timer.\n• Reset discards the current session.\n• Completed work sessions are saved automatically.\n\nA streak requires the minimum daily recorded work time configured above. The dashboard keeps your work minutes and groups them by day, month or year.": {
    "Alternate work sessions and short breaks.\n\n• Pause suspends the timer without saving.\n• Record session saves whole minutes and prepares a new work timer.\n• Reset discards the current session.\n• Completed work sessions are saved automatically.\n\nA streak requires the minimum daily recorded work time configured above. The dashboard keeps your work minutes and groups them by day, month or year.": "Alterna sessioni di lavoro e pause brevi.\n\n• Pausa sospende il timer senza salvare.\n• Registra sessione salva i minuti interi e prepara un nuovo timer di lavoro.\n• Reset scarta la sessione corrente.\n• Le sessioni completate si salvano automaticamente.\n\nLa streak richiede il tempo minimo di lavoro registrato al giorno configurato sopra. La dashboard conserva i minuti di lavoro e li raggruppa per giorno, mese o anno."
  },
